# What the binary embeds is served byte for byte, and tests read it byte for
# byte: the vendored emulator against the checksums its README records, the
# pages by the exact shape of their script tags. Git must not rewrite line
# endings in any of it at checkout, which on Windows it otherwise does. The
# program's table goldens are compared byte for byte the same way.
api/assets/**  -text
api/*.html     -text
api/testdata/* -text
cmd/rota/testdata/* -text
cmd/rota/hold/testdata/** -text
cmd/rota/tui/testdata/** -text
